<%# The ReviewTimeline.astro figure, as the Astro site drew it: an illustration, animated by figures.js. %>
<div class="rt" data-fig-scene="review"><div class="rt-lanes"><div class="rt-lane-label"><span class="fig-label">What you're shown</span><span class="fig-label">What the ad is doing</span></div><div class="rt-beat" data-anim="beat"><div class="rt-time fig-label">T+0s</div><div class="rt-cell rt-top"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>You click publish</div><div class="rt-cell rt-ok"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Campaign created</div></div><div class="rt-beat" data-anim="beat"><div class="rt-time fig-label">T+1s</div><div class="rt-cell rt-top"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>API returns success</div><div class="rt-cell rt-ok"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Ad group created</div></div><div class="rt-beat" data-anim="beat"><div class="rt-time fig-label">T+2s</div><div class="rt-cell rt-top"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Dashboard says live</div><div class="rt-cell rt-ok"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Ad created</div></div><div class="rt-beat" data-anim="beat"><div class="rt-time fig-label">~T+20m</div><div class="rt-cell rt-top rt-stale"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Dashboard still says live</div><div class="rt-cell rt-bad"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-bad" aria-hidden="true"></span>Policy review rejects the ad</div></div><div class="rt-beat" data-anim="beat"><div class="rt-time fig-label">Day 4</div><div class="rt-cell rt-top rt-stale"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-ok" aria-hidden="true"></span>Still says live</div><div class="rt-cell rt-bad"><span class="rt-dot rt-dot-bad" aria-hidden="true"></span>Never served. Budget untouched.</div></div></div><div class="rt-split" data-anim="split"><span class="rt-split-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>They stop agreeing here, and nothing in the apply path ever tells you.</div><div class="rt-fix" data-anim="fix"><span class="fig-label">What Lumin Ads adds</span><p>Review is polled after every apply and written back as a <strong>separate axis from status</strong>. A rejection flips the change to <span class="rt-code">REVIEW_REJECTED</span> and notifies whoever proposed it, and it is the first thing the agents check on the next run.</p></div></div>
